(text "J3 expansion bus (2x30 IDC, keyed).\nA16-A23 are the latched bank byte (U2), valid while PHI2 is high.\nA19-A22 are not decoded on the board, so an expansion device in\nbanks $08-$7F collides with the on-board RAM aliases: use the\n~{IOn} slots ($6400-$7FFF, 1 KB each) for expansion I/O.\n~{IRQ}, ~{NMI}, RDY, ~{ABORT}, BE have pull-ups on the CPU sheet:\ndrive them open drain only." (at 45.72 182.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 811aa0d0-07e8-5bcd-b497-6626ed8f8881))
