(text "Clock source.  JP1 1-2: X1 oscillator (normal).  JP1 2-3: J5\nexternal clock, e.g. a single-step or 555 clock module.\nR19 keeps CLK_EXT low when nothing is plugged in.\nThe GAL divides CLK2 by two: two external pulses per bus cycle." (at 266.7 91.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 8780b92f-3393-5dd5-8a4e-6c655f7b60ca))
