(text "PHI2 drive.  The ATF22V10C only guarantees VOH = 2.4 V at 4 mA;\nthe W65C816S wants about 3.5 V on PHI2.  JP2 1-2 (default):\nPHI2 straight from GAL pin 23, as on the breadboard.  JP2 2-3:\nthrough U10A, a TTL-input (VIH 2.0 V) gate with full-swing outputs.\nThe buffer delays PHI2 by up to ~10 ns relative to the GAL's\ninternal PHI2; see decode.pld NOTE 8.  Unused gates: inputs to GND." (at 266.7 167.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid ff616606-8578-54fc-8419-36170866cc2d))
